## 3. A note on the figures

Every number in this repository describes the Olist dataset as published. It is real
transactional data from a real marketplace, but it covers one company over a fixed window
(September 2016 to October 2018) and nothing here should be read as a general claim about
e-commerce logistics, nor as a measured business outcome produced by this analysis.
